AI-Powered Data Quality & Cleaning Engine
Beginner-friendly Pandas ETL and Gemini integration.
Outputs
`output/cleaned_data.csv`
`output/rejected_data.csv`
`output/quality_report.json`
Run
1.Open `notebook/data_quality_engine.ipynb` in Jupyter.
2.Run cells from top to bottom.
3. Install `google-genai`, create a key in Google AI Studio, and set `GEMINI_API_KEY` as an environment variable before launching/restarting Jupyter.
Pandas owns validation decisions. Gemini receives aggregate metrics provides advisory interpretation. Raw input is never overwritten; rejected records are preserved.
